-cbbdf176fdb8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"まあ、頑張ってみても wilder に勝つのは難しいかもですね…。modifier まで全部管理している…。","ts":"1634530633.004000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sugoi","count":1,"users":["U02BDFBM620"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JSn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d22c8058-393a-402f-87d8-d81677400419","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ありがとうございます、そんな感じになりますよね","ts":"1634530514.002700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o81"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c212ed66-79be-4a8f-9190-f10686d26ea6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これでいけました。","ts":"1634529819.002200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p0se"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a8d32f2f-2279-462a-88ec-5a356c20f145","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"```    exec = function(arglead, cmdline, curpos)\n      local name = cmdline:match([=[^[ \u0026lt;'\u0026gt;]*(%a*)]=])\n      if not name then\n        return {}\n      end\n      for name_, option in pairs(vim.api.nvim_get_commands({})) do\n        if name_ == name then\n          if vim.tbl_contains({ 'customlist', 'custom' }, option.complete) then\n            local func = string.gsub(option.complete_arg, 's:', ('\u0026lt;SNR\u0026gt;%d_'):format(option.script_id))\n            local items = vim.api.nvim_call_function(func, { arglead, cmdline, curpos })\n            if type(items) == 'string' then\n              return vim.split(items, '\\n')\n            end\n            return items\n          end\n        end\n      end\n      return {}\n    end```","ts":"1634529814.002000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=GV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67ebb808-5350-419d-b5fc-e0dee7b6f8b1","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"neovim 限定であれば customlist の対応できました。結構ややこしい。コー